{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126110505931-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126112223\"/><p>尖沙咀有貓隻懷疑受虐。今日(26日)早上9時13分，加連威老道100號一動物診所獸醫報案，指一隻貓咪身體有骨折，懷疑曾遭不恰當對待。人員接報到場經調查後，案件列「虐待動物」處理，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.420131+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:35:37.765126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:06.636851+00:00","content_hash":"c489a5563ca866dc00a2a9f6f853ce4fa77103b13cf7482ee0a664771c1b1804","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}